# The contact form submits to FormSubmit (https://formsubmit.co) using the
# email in CONTACT.email (src/data/nav.ts) — no API key, signup, or env var
# needed.
#
# One manual step is required after deploying: the *first* submission to a
# new FormSubmit address triggers a confirmation email to that inbox. Until
# someone clicks "Activate Form" in that email, submissions are accepted but
# not delivered. Submit the form once after going live, then check the inbox.
